extends layout 
block title 
    title About Us

block content
    .title
      h1 DreamZZZ
    //
      The all the paragraph below, including all the bullet point are generate by LLM(Chat GPT) 
       with prompt: I want the service to be someone hire to sleep for client so that the client have enough sleep
    .about
      div(class="main_img")
        img(
          alt="sleeping cat" 
          src="/resources/images/main/cat_sleep2.png"
          )
      div(class="about_content")
        p
          | Welcome to
          strong DreamZZZ
          | , the first service that helps busy people get the rest they don't 
          |   have time for. We know life is hectic — work, school, family, deadlines 
          |   — and sleep is often the first thing people sacrifice. 
          |   That's where we step in.
        p
          | At
          strong DreamZZZ
          | , you can hire a professional sleeper to rest on your behalf. 
          |   While you power through your day, our certified sleepers clock the hours you're missing. 
          |   Think of it as “sleep outsourcing” — you stay productive, while we keep your sleep account balanced.
        p Our services include:
        ul
          li
            strong Power Nap Package:
            | 30 minutes of premium rest, logged just for you.
          li
            strong Overnight Coverage:
            | Eight full hours of high-quality dreaming.
          li
            strong Dream Customization:
            | Dream about the topic of your choice
        p
          | At
          strong DreamZZZ
          | we don't just dream big, we dream for you.
        h1 The People Behind DreamZZZ
        .people
          .people1
            img.pp1(
              alt="smile dog" 
              src="/resources/images/dog.jpg"
              )
            p Yongchean Chhy
          .people2
            img.pp2(
              alt="Giorno Giovanna" 
              src="/resources/images/jojo.png"
              )
            p Giorno Giovanna
          .people3
            img.pp3(
              alt="Gold Ship" 
              src="/resources/images/goldship.png"
              )
            p Gold Ship